#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:1
msgid "Fengxian R&D expenditure increase reimbursement, 2026"
msgstr "2026年奉賢区研究開発費増加額補助"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:4
msgid "Reimbursement | Fengxian"
msgstr "事後精算・費用補助 | 奉賢区"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:6
msgid "Closed"
msgstr "募集終了"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S125 "
"<https://www.fengxian.gov.cn/kw/tzgg/20260602/108031.html>`_. "
"奉贤区2026年“南上海科创中心”创新行动计划——研发费用补贴项目申报指南_通知公告."
msgstr "`出典 S125 <https://www.fengxian.gov.cn/kw/tzgg/20260602/108031.html>`_. 奉贤区2026年“南上海科创中心”创新行动计划——研发费用补贴项目申报指南_通知公告."

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "金額規模と支援メカニズム"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:13
msgid ""
"30% of the qualifying annual R&D net increase, capped at RMB 1 million"
msgstr "前年度からの適格研究開発費の純増額の30％を補助（最大100万元まで）"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "株式提供の義務なし"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "申請資格とスケジュール・期限"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:20
msgid ""
"Valid recognized high-tech enterprise or 2025 registered technology SME; "
"2024 and 2025 tax finalization and R&D super-deduction schedules are "
"required. Submit online and route the paper pack through the recommending "
"unit."
msgstr "有効期間内の国家ハイテク企業、または2025年登録テクノロジー型中小企業。2024年および2025年の税務確定申告書およびR&D加算控除明細書の提出が必要。オンライン申請後、推薦組織を通じて紙面一式を提出。"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:22
msgid ""
"Online closed 17 June 2026, 17:00; paper closed 30 June 2026, 17:00 China "
"Standard Time"
msgstr "オンライン申請は2026年6月17日 17:00、紙面提出は6月30日 17:00（いずれも中国標準時）に終了"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "連絡先と申請方法"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route <https://fxkjxmxt.cn/website/>`_"
msgstr "`公式申請窓口／政策ポータル <https://fxkjxmxt.cn/website/>`_"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:29
msgid "Published consultation: +86 21 33610530."
msgstr "公開相談電話：+86 21 33610530。"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "編集部作成の申請チェックリスト。実際の申請手続きは現行の公式通知または契約書が優先されます。"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:33
msgid ""
"Confirm the actual category, area boundary, supplier and eligible "
"expenditure period."
msgstr "対象区分、利用範囲、サービス提供者、経費の対象期間を確認する。"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:35
msgid ""
"Keep service contracts, invoices, payment evidence and itemized usage "
"logs."
msgstr "契約書、発票（中国の税務インボイス）、支払証明、利用明細を保存する。"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:37
msgid ""
"Use the named platform and current batch; obtain the required district or "
"operator review."
msgstr "指定システムの該当募集回に申請し、区や運営者の審査を受ける。"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:39
msgid ""
"Check approved amount, duplicate-funding exclusions and payment "
"conditions."
msgstr "認定額、重複助成の制限、支払条件を確認する。"

#: ../../funding/fengxian-rd-increase.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公表されている上限額は助成限度額であり、受給権を保証するものではありません。該当する通知、対象経費の支出期間、他の公的支援の有無、および書面の交付条件を確認してください。"
